w Zealand, North and South America, Africa, Europe, and Other Asian countries. It also provides management services; herbicides, fungicides, and insecticides; ethanol, phosphoric acid, adhesives, carbon dioxide, and sealants; switchgear; airport management solutions; cyber security technologies and services; application software and services for cloud-based and on-premise software for ERP, analytics and big data, oil and gas supply base, anti-money laundering and fraud, and cooperative membership and management; and media marketing, cinema, digital advertising, and media related services. In addition, the company organizes and promotes motor sports; buys, sells, and deals in motors; markets polyurethane and polyvinyl chloride synthetic leather, vinyl-coated fabrics, calendered film and sheets, geotextiles, and geosynthetic products; and prefabricated subsoil drainage system, and property development. Further, it offers ship-owning, land transportation, ship-operating, charter hire of tanker, ship management, container haulage, cargo handling, and chemical warehousing services; polymer, logistics, and information technology consultancy services; electrical component; pest control, hygiene, and sanitation services; animal healthcare products; printing services of newspapers, magazines, books, journals, and literary works; building, owning, operating, leasing, and managing chemical tank farm; grows banana and durian; general trading; freight and call centre services; gasoline blending components; money lending; timber and preservatives chemical products; medical equipment; and dealing, subletting, and investing in properties. The company was formerly known as Ancom Berhad. The company was incorporated in 1969 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"Ancom Nylex Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于1969年，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也，在马来西亚、新加坡、印度尼西亚、其他东南亚国家、澳大利亚和新西兰、南北美洲、非洲、欧洲及其他亚洲国家制造和贸易农业、石化和工业化学品。","lines":["农业化学品：制造和贸易除草剂、杀菌剂和杀虫剂。","工业化学品：提供乙醇、磷酸、粘合剂、二氧化碳和密封胶。","物流与仓储：提供船舶拥有、陆地运输、船舶运营、油轮租赁、船舶管理、集装箱运输、货物装卸和化学品仓储服务。","数字与技术服务：提供网络安全技术和服务、基于云和本地部署的ERP、分析和大数据、石油和天然气供应基地、反洗钱和欺诈、合作社成员和管理应用软件和服务，以及媒体营销、影院、数字广告和媒体相关服务。","合成皮革与土工材料：营销聚氨酯和聚氯乙烯合成皮革、乙烯基涂层织物、压延薄膜和片材、土工布和土工合成产品。"],"lines_en":["Agricultural Chemicals: Manufactures and trades herbicides, fungicides, and insecticides.","Industrial Chemicals: Supplies ethanol, phosphoric acid, adhesives, carbon dioxide, and sealants.","Logistics & Warehousing: Provides ship-owning, land transportation, ship-operating, charter hire of tanker, ship management, container haulage, cargo handling, and chemical warehousing services.","Digital & Technology Services: Offers cyber security technologies and services, application software and services for cloud-based and on-premise software for ERP, analytics and big data, oil and gas supply base, anti-money laundering and fraud, and cooperative membership and management, and media marketing, cinema, digital advertising, and media related services.","Synthetic Leather & Geosynthetics: Markets polyurethane and polyvinyl chloride synthetic leather, vinyl-coated fabrics, calendered film and sheets, geotextiles, and geosynthetic products."]}}